<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2106] Provide ability to create charts through REST API</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2106</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Provide the ability to create charts through REST API. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Users should be able to provide chart information (e.g., barchart, piechart, etc) while creating a paragraph through the REST API. When user opens the notebook, this paragraph should show up with the newly created chart. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
