                            <comment id="15896935" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 6 Mar 2017 09:09:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user Remilito opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2099&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2099&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2106&quot; title=&quot;Provide ability to create charts through REST API&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2106&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2106&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; providing paragraph config in create note/paragraph rest call&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Allow to provide graph info, colWidth, showTitle or even full paragraph config&lt;br/&gt;
    directly in the Create Paragraph and Create Note endpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Save calls to &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;noteId&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;/paragraph/&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;paragraphId&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;/config&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Updated doc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;



&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What type of PR is it?&lt;br/&gt;
    Improvement&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
